WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Turn a repeated task into a clear, reusable Python function.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:10.260
Check that the maximum is positive and the score is in range, then return the calculation.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.678
Which statement sends a function's result to its caller?

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:18.855
return provides a value to the calling expression; print displays text.
